J1 / J1a originally by James Bowman (swapforth), BSD-3-Clause.
`j1.v`, `stack2.v`, and `uart.v` are vendored from that project.
`swapforth/` is the J1a Forth (`cross.fs`, `nuc.fs`, `swapforth.fs`, `common/core.fs`, `common/core-ext.fs`) with its BSD text in `swapforth/LICENSE`.
`j1_wrap.v` loads `firmware.hex` and runs that core.
